# src/apps/android/app/src/androidTest/java/com/luminet/android

## Purpose
Holds LumiNet Android instrumentation tests that validate behavior requiring an Android runtime, emulator, or platform services.

## Contents
Contains device-facing test classes and any nested feature-specific instrumentation-test packages.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Uses Android test APIs and the installed app-under-test; assertions should observe public or intended application/platform behavior.

## Invariants
Tests must remain deterministic across supported emulator environments, clean up platform state they mutate, and never ship in the production APK.